{"3902800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "[HERROR] Gas Station Case", "steam_appid": 3902800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4916070], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[HERROR] is a series of short horror episodes where everyday work routines collide with paranormal threats. Each episode is a unique standalone story lasting 1.5–2 hours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re looking at the first episode of the [HERROR] anthology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902800/extras/63b56005cec1de712ffacc1975c49716.poster.avif?t=1787426808\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902800/extras/63b56005cec1de712ffacc1975c49716.webm?t=1787426808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902800/extras/63b56005cec1de712ffacc1975c49716.mp4?t=1787426808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[HERROR] Gas Station Case</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dan Cooper, a 25-year-old night shift gas station worker in Ohio, recently laid off from a uranium plant, is trying to put his life back together. But everything changes when his friend Michael discovers a mysterious case by the lake. Soon, people begin to vanish in the surrounding woods, and the cozy gas station turns into a deadly trap.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is primarily a first-person narrative walking simulator featuring exploration, work, and dialogue mechanics, inspired by series like <i>Fears to Fathom</i> and <i>Chilla's Art</i>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric environments and cozy visuals.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light VHS tape aesthetics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience working as a gas station attendant.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A carefully crafted story full of small details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional “Silent Screamers” mode for players who fear jumpscares but still want to enjoy the atmosphere and story of horror.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-sitting episode. Demo 20–30 min. Full chapter 90–120 min. Anthology format — episodes connected by tone, not plot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like Fears to Fathom, Chilla’s Art, Zoochosis or Mouthwashing, you’ll feel at home here.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for mid-range PCs and laptops. Scalable graphics options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DMCA-safe soundtrack. The in-game vintage film is public domain — safe for streaming.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyday setting: night-shift job at a gas station. Job-sim flavor: serve customers, answer calls, keep the shift running.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Emotional moments that evoke vivid reactions: fear, laughter, tension, surprise and more.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[HERROR] is a series of short horror episodes where everyday work routines collide with paranormal threats. Each episode is a unique standalone story lasting 1.5–2 hours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re looking at the first episode of the [HERROR] anthology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3902800/extras/63b56005cec1de712ffacc1975c49716.poster.avif?t=1787426808\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.st